From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jason chien <3936511+jason5545@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 08:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] kk: drop the PrimitiveShadingRateKHR output

dxil-spirv declares BuiltIn PrimitiveShadingRateKHR for every D3D12 shader
that writes SV_ShadingRate, whether or not the device has variable rate
shading. KosmicKrisp does not expose VK_KHR_fragment_shading_rate and
nir_to_msl has no name for VARYING_SLOT_PRIMITIVE_SHADING_RATE, so the
vertex output became "uint (null) [[(null)]]" and Metal refused the
library (12 vertex shaders of MSFS 2024 in the main menu). Without
variable rate shading every primitive is shaded at the full rate: turn the
output variable into a temporary before IO lowering so it is removed.

Applies after 0003.
---
diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_shader.c b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_shader.c
index c0bceca8113..010e1af01fd 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_shader.c
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_shader.c
@@ -796,6 +796,30 @@ kk_lower_nir(struct kk_device *dev, nir_shader *nir, bool emulated_stage,
    NIR_PASS(_, nir, nir_lower_explicit_io, nir_var_mem_ubo,
             kk_buffer_addr_format(rs->uniform_buffers));
 
+   /* Metal has no per-primitive shading rate and KosmicKrisp does not expose
+    * VK_KHR_fragment_shading_rate, yet dxil-spirv declares the
+    * PrimitiveShadingRateKHR output of every D3D12 shader that writes
+    * SV_ShadingRate (MSFS 2024 has such vertex shaders). The slot has no MSL
+    * name, so the library failed to compile. Without variable rate shading
+    * every primitive is shaded at the full rate: drop the output. */
+   if (nir->info.stage != MESA_SHADER_FRAGMENT) {
+      bool dropped = false;
+      nir_foreach_shader_out_variable(var, nir) {
+         if (var->data.location == VARYING_SLOT_PRIMITIVE_SHADING_RATE) {
+            var->data.mode = nir_var_shader_temp;
+            dropped = true;
+         }
+      }
+      if (dropped) {
+         NIR_PASS(_, nir, nir_fixup_deref_modes);
+         NIR_PASS(_, nir, nir_lower_global_vars_to_local);
+         NIR_PASS(_, nir, nir_lower_vars_to_ssa);
+         NIR_PASS(_, nir, nir_opt_dce);
+         NIR_PASS(_, nir, nir_remove_dead_variables, nir_var_function_temp,
+                  NULL);
+      }
+   }
+
    NIR_PASS(_, nir, nir_lower_io, nir_var_shader_in | nir_var_shader_out,
             type_size_vec4,
             nir_lower_io_lower_64bit_to_32 |
